<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Rom</book>
  <para style="h">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">Rom</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Isua Krista bawih, tirhkoh atâna koh, Pathian Chanchin Ṭha hril tûra tihhrana chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chu Chanchin Ṭha chu Pathianin a zâwlneite hmangin a lehkha thianghlimah a lo tiam tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A Fapa, kan Lalpa Isua Krista thu chu tisa lam chhui chuan Davida thlaha piang a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thianghlimna thlarau lamah erawh chuan; mitthi zîng ata ropui taka kaihthawh a nihna chuan Pathian Fapa a nihzia a tilang chiang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amah avâng chuan Pathianin hnam tin zînga mite ringa awihtîr tûrin tirhkoh nihna chanvo min hlân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangni pawh chutianga Krista mite ni tûra koh in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathianin a duh tak, a mi thianghlim ni tûra a koh Rom khuaa mite chibai ka bûk a che u. Pathian kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ringtu in nih thu ram tina a than tâk huai huai avângin Isua Krista zârah nangmahni avângin Pathian hnênah lâwmthu ka sawi hmasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ṭawngṭainaahte chuan ka hre reng ṭhîn che u a, tih tak meuhva a Fapa Chanchin Ṭha rawng ka bâwl Pathian chu mi hriatpuitu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A remtih zâwng a nih chuan tûn ṭumah tal ka rawn tlawh theihna tûr che uin Pathian ka dîl ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In ngheh lehzual nân thlarau lam thilpêk dawntîr tûr che uin hmuh che u ka chak êm êm a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />kei leh nangni hi rinnaa kan inchâwm tawna, kan inṭanpui tawn theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute u, rawn tlawh che u ka tum fo va; mahse, rem lohna a awm leh ṭhîn a ni tih in hriat ka duh a ni. Jentail dang zînga ka hmuh ṭhin angin in zîngah pawh rah hmuh ve ka beisei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Grik mite leh Awze mite, mi fing leh mi mâwlte hnênah bat ka nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chuvângin, a ni, nangni Rom khuaa awmte hnênah pawh Chanchin Ṭha hi hril ka châk êm êm ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha hi ka zahpui si lo va, tu pawh a ring apiangte chhandam nâna Pathian thiltihtheihna a ni si a; Juda-te tân a ni phawt a, Jentail-te tân pawh a ni leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hetah hian rinna avâng chauhva Pathianin mi thiam a chantîr dân a lo lang ta a ni, “Rinna avânga thiam chang chu a nung ang,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vân ata Pathian thinurna chu mihring, an sakhaw ngaihsak lohna leh suahsualna avânga thutak dodâl tlattute chungah chuan a lo lang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian chanchin hriat theih tûr chi chu mihringte hnênah a lang reng a, chu chu Pathian ngeiin a tihlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nihna, mita hmuh theih loh, a chatuan thiltihtheihna leh a Pathianzia chu khawvêl siam tirh ata a thil siamahte chuan chiang taka hmuh theihin a lang a. Phatna tûr rêng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian zawng an hria a ni; Pathian ang erawh chuan an chawimawi lo va, lâwmthu pawh an hrilh hek lo; an ngaihtuahna a khawlo zo va, an rilru lawilo tak chu a thim zo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Fing an inti nâ a, an â hle si a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thi thei lo Pathian ropuina chu thi thei mihring te, sava te, ke pali nei te leh rannung lim ang lekah an chantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, an thinlung châkzâwng thil bawlhhlawhte ti tûrin Pathianin a hawisan a, zahpuiawm takin an awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian thutak aiin dâwt an thlang a, a siamtu chu biak aiin a siama chu biain a rawng an bâwl ta zâwk a. A siamtu chu chatuana fakin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chûng avâng chuan a ni Pathianin zahthlâk taka an hur phalin a hawisan tâk ni; an hmeichhiate chu an awm dân phung pêlin an khawsa a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />an mipate lah hmeichhe hman dân pangngai bânsanin, hurin an inît tawn a, mipa leh mipa mawi lo takin an khawsa a. Anmahni taksa ngeiah an sual rah chu an hmu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian hriatna dik chu an thlah tâk avângin an ngaihtuahna khawlo tak anga awm tûrin Pathianin a hawisan a, an tih loh tawp tûr pawh an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Dik lohna chi tinrêngin an lo khat ta a, sualna te, duhâmna te leh suahsualna te, îtsîkna te, tual thah te, in erna te, inbumna te leh inhuatna tein an khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An inrêl a, an insawichhia a, Pathian an hua a, an intivei a, an chapo va, an uang a, thil ṭha lo thar an chîng chhuak zêl a; an nu leh pate an zah lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />pawisak an nei lo va, lainatna lah an nei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutiang thil titute chu Pathianin a ruat ang ngeia thi tlâk an ni tih hre reng chungin, an ti lui zêl a, a ti vete pawh an ngaisâng lehnghâl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw mihring, tu pawh ni la, mi dang thiam loh chantîr thei i ni bîk hlei nêm, mi i thiam lohna ngei chu nang pawhin i ti ve tho si a, mahni leh mahni thiam loh inchantîr mai i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutiang ti mite chu Pathianin thiam loh a chantîr chuan a tidik a ni tih kan hria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nangin i tih ṭhin ang tite i thiam loh si chuan, Pathianin a demna che chu pumpelh i inring em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nih loh leh, simtîr che a duh avângin Pathian chuan ngilnei takin a nghâk ṭhîn che tih hre lovin, ṭhatna a ngahzia leh a dawhtheihzia leh a entheihzia chu i ngainêp em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I luhlul leh i thinlung khauh avângin thinurna ni, dik taka Pathianin ro a rêlna ni atân chuan mahni tân hremna chhêk khâwl lek i ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian chuan mi tin an thiltih ang zêlin a rêlsak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ropuina te, chawimawina te leh boral theih lohna te zawnga thil ṭha ti fan fante chu chatuan nunna a pe ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />nimahsela, mahni hma chauh siala, thutak hnara, thil dik lo zâwm zâwkte chungah chuan Pathian thinurna leh thinrimna a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil sual ti apiangte tân hrehawmna te, lungngaihna te a awm dâwn - Juda-te tân a awm phawt ang a, Grik mite tân pawh a awm ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thil ṭha ti apiangte erawh chuan Pathian hnên aṭangin ropuina te, chawimawina te leh thlamuanna te an dawng ang. Juda-ten an dawng phawt ang a, Grik mite pawhin an dawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathianin mi duhsak bîk a nei si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dân hnuaia awm loten thil sual an tih chuan Dân lovin an thi ang: Dân hnuaia awmten thil sual an tih chuan Dân angin an chungthu rêl a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dân hriat vâng ni lovin, zawma zawm vâng zâwkin Pathian hmaah chuan thiam chan theih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jentail-te chuan Dân chu an hre ve lo na a, Dân thu tum chu an pianpui ze phung remzâwng a nih avângin an ti a, Dân chu an hnêna pêk ni ve lo mah se, Dân nei ang an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An chhia leh ṭha hriatnaah thiam inchantîr leh inchantîr loh nachâng an inhriat dân aṭang hian Dân thupêk chu an thinlungah a inziak a ni tih a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathianin Isua Krista hmanga mihringte thurûk a ngaihtuah ni-ah chuan Chanchin Ṭha ka hril ang hian a rêl dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nih, nang, Juda mi i inti a; Dân chu i rinchhan a, Pathian chu i chhuang hle a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian duhzâwng pawh i hria a. Dân i hriat avângin a chhia leh a ṭha pawh i hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mitdelte hruaitu, thima awmte tâna êng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mi mâwlte hruai fing theitu, naupangte zirtîrtu ber ni-ah i inngai ṭhîn; hriat tûr leh thutak zawng zawng chu Dân thu-ah hian a awm vek tih i ring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi dang ka zirtîr e i ti a, engati nge mahni i inzirtîr si loh? Ru lo tûrin mi i zirtîr a, nangin i ru si maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uire i khap a, nang i uire si em ni? Milem haw hle siin milem biakna Tempul i rawk duh si maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dân chu chhuang hle siin, Dân chu bawhchhiain Pathian i tihmingchhe ṭhîn maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nangmahni avângin Pathian hming chu Jentail-te zîngah sawichhiat a ni,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dân zâwm la chu i serh tan pawh kha a sâwt hle tûr; Dân i bawhchhiat si chuan serh tan loh ang chiah i ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Serh tan lohvin Dân a zawm si chuan serh tan anga ngaih a ni dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangnin serh in tan a, Dân thu ziak pawh in nei a; mahse, Dân thu chu in bawhchhe si, Jentail, tisa serh tan lohte chuan Dân thu chu an zâwm tlat zâwk si a, thiam loh an chantîr dâwn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A lang maia Juda mi ni chu Juda mi tak tak a ni lo va, tisa maia serh tan chu serh tan tak tak a ni bawk hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />amaherawhchu, chhûng rila Juda mi ni chu Juda tak tak chu a ni a, serh tan tak tak pawh chu thinlung lamah a ni, lehkhaa ziak maiah ni lovin, thlarau lamah a ni zâwk. Chutiang mi chu mihringin chawimawi lo mah se, Pathianin a chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuti chu Juda mi nih a sâwtna a awm chuang em ni? Serh tan pawh eng nge a hlâwkna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kawng tinah hlâwk tak a ni. A hlâwkna ber chu Pathian thute kawltîr an nihna hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhatte rinawm lo ta sela, engtin nge ni ta ang? Anni rinawm lohna chuan Pathian rinawmna chu a tibo dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tibo suh e; mi zawng zawng dawthei ni vek mah se, Pathian zawng a dik ngei tûr a ni: “Nangin thu i sawi huna thiam i chana, Rorêlsaka i awm huna i hneh theih nân,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan dik lohna chuan Pathian dikzia a tihlan chian lehzual si chuan, engtin nge kan ngaih ang? Mihring takin sawi ila - Pathianin thinurna a rawn lantîr hian a tidik lo kan ti dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ti teh suh e, chuti ni se Pathian chuan engtin nge khawvêl ro a rêl theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nih loh leh, dawthei ka nihna hian Pathian a ropui nâna Pathian dikzia a tihlan chian lehzual si chuan, engati nge mi suala mi la chhiar cheu vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhatin, “ ‘Thil ṭha a lo chhuah theih nân thil sual i ti ang u,’ a ti e,” ti-a min sawichhiat ang khân, thil sual kan ti mai dâwn em ni? Chûng mite chu thiam loh chang awm rêng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nih leh keini Juda-te hi kan ṭha bîk em ni? Ṭha bîk teh suh e. Juda-te leh Grik-te chu sual bawiha awm vek kan ni tih kan sawi fiah tawh kha:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Tu mah mi fel rêng an awm lo, Pakhat mah an awm lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu mah hrethiam rêng an awm lo, Pathian zawng rêng an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An pêng bo ta vek a, an khawlo zo ta a; Tu mah thil ṭha ti rêng an awm lo, pakhat mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An hrawk chu thlân inhawng a ni a, an leiin bumna thu an sawi a, an hmui aṭangin rûl tûr a chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An kâ chu ânchhia leh thu khain a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thisen chhuah tûrin an pên chak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An kalna apiangah chhiatna leh lungngaihna an thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlamuanna kawng an hre hauh lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian ṭih nachâng rêng an hre hek lo,’ tia ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dân thute chu Dân hnuaia awmte chunga hman tûr a ni tih kan hria, tu man eng mah an sawi theih lohna tûr leh khawvêl hi Pathian rorêla a awmna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dân zawm ṭhat avângin tu mah Pathian hmaah thiam chang pha an awm lo; Dân avângin miin thil sual an tih an inhre fiah ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûnah zawng Dân hman ngai lova mi thiam a chantîr dân Pathian chuan a rawn tilang ta: Dân leh zâwlneite thu pawhin chu chu a sawi kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isua Krista an rin avângin tu pawh a ring apiangte chu Pathianin thiam a chantîr a ni, danglamna rêng a awm lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mi zawng zawngin thil sual an ti vek a, Pathian ropuina chu an chang thei ta lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isua Krista tlanna zârah Pathian chuan a khawngaihna avâng chauhvin chûng mite chu a thlâwnin thiam a chantîr ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathianin ani chu a thisen rin avânga sual thupha chawina ni tûrin a ruat a, mi thiam a chantîr dân tilang tûra ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A dawhtheihna avângin tûn hma lam sualte chu Pathianin a haider a; amah chu a dik a, Isua ringtute chu thiam a chantîr tih tifiah tûrin tûnlai hunah hian mi thiam a chantîr dân chu a rawn tilang ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuti chu chhuan tûr rêng kan nei em ni? Nei suh e! Eng vângin maw? Thiltih vângin maw? Ni lo ve, rinna avâng a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dân zawm vâng ni lovin rinna avângin miin thiam an chang kan ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian chu Juda-te ta bîk em ni? Jentail-te ta pawh a ni lo vem ni? Ni e, Jentail-te ta pawh a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian chu pakhat a ni a, serh tanho chu an rinna avângin thiam a chantîr ang a, serh tan lohho pawh an rinna avâng bawkin thiam a chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuti ni se, rinna kan sawi pawimawh avângin Dân chu eng mah lovah kan dah ta tihna em ni? Ni suh e; Dân chu kan ṭan zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuti ni se, tisa lama min thlahtu Abrahama thu kha engtin nge kan sawi tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thiltih avânga thiam chantîr ni se, Abrahama khân chhuan tûr a nei mahna, amaherawhchu, Pathian hmaah chhuan tûr a nei hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in eng nge a sawi kha? “Abrahama chuan Pathian a ring a, chu a rinna avâng chuan thiam chantîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hna thawktu hlawh chu khawngaih thilpêk a ni lo va, bat anga ngaih a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi sual thiam chantîrtu chu miin a rina, thil tih vâng ni lova thiam chantîra a awm hian, a rinna avângin thiam a chang kan ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiltih vâng ni lova Pathianin thiam a chantîrte nihlawhzia Davida pawhin hetiang hian a sawi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘An bawhchhiatnate ngaihdamsaka awma, an sualte thai bova awmte chu an va nihlawh êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan sual neia a ruat loh chu an nihlawh e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu malsâwmna chu serh tan tân chauh nge serh tan lohte tân pawh? “Abrahaman a rinna avângin thiam a chang,” tih a ni kan ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A serh tan hma thu nge a serh tan hnu thu? Engtia ngaih tûr nge? A serh tan hnu ni lovin, a serh tan hma thu a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A serh tan hmaa a rinna avâng ngeiin Pathianin thiam a chantîr tih entîr tûrin serh a tan chauh zâwk a ni. Tichuan, serh tan lo mah se rinna avânga Pathianin thiam a chantîrte tân chuan Abrahama chu an thlarau lam pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Serh tante pa pawh a ni, serh tan an nih mai vâng ni lovin, kan pa Abrahaman serh a tan hmaa a rin ang bawka rinna an neih avângin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dân zawm vâng ni lovin, rinnaa thiam chantîr a nih avâng zâwkin Pathian chuan Abrahama hnênah amah leh a thlahte chuan khawvêl hi an rochung dâwn a ni tih thu a tiam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dân zawm hi roluahtu nihna ni se, rinna hi thil lothlâwn mai a ni ang a, thutiam pawh chu eng mah a ni lo tihna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dân chuan thinurna chu a hring a, Dân awm lo sela bawhchhiatna pawh a awm dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abrahama thlah zawng zawng tân, Dân zâwmtute chauh ni lovin, ama rin anga ringtute tân Pathian thilthlâwnpêk a nihzia tilang tûrin rinna avângin a ni, Abrahama hnênah thu a tiam ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘chi tam tak paah ka siam ta che,’ tih ziak ang khân, a rin Pathian, mitthite tinung lehtu, thil awm lote awmtîrtu hmuhah chuan; ani chu kan zavaia pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Beisei tûr a awm loh pawhin beiseiin a ring tlat a; tichuan, chi tam tak pa a lo ni ta, ‘I thlahte chu khiti zât khi an la ni ang,’ tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kum za dâwn lai a ni tawh a, a taksa ngaihtuah chuan mitthi ang mai a ni tawh a, Sari pawh chu fa nei rual a ni tawh lo tih a hre reng chungin, a rinna a chuai chuang lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />rinna tlachhamin Pathian thutiam chu a ringhlel lo va, a rinna a chak tial tial a; tichuan, Pathianin a chawimawi ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thutiamtu chuan a tiam tawh chu a hlen thei ngei ang tih a ring tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan alâwm, a rinna avânga thiam chantîr a ni an tih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hei hi ama chungthu sawina atân maia ziak a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keiniho, kan Lalpa Isua mitthi zîng ata kaithotu ringtute, rin vânga thiam chang tate tân pawh hian ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isua chu kan bawhchhiatnate avângin tihhlum a ni a, thiam kan channa tûra kaihthawh a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, rin vânga thiam kan chan tâk avângin, kan Lal Isua Krista zârah Pathian nên inremin kan awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah avâng vêk chuan tûna kan awmna, khawngaihna hnuaiah hian, rinnain kan lût ta a, Pathian ropuina kan la ṭâwm tûr beiseina avângin kan lâwm bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu bâkah kan hrehawmnaah pawh kan lâwm zêl a ni; hrehawmna chuan chhelna a hring ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chhelna pawh chuan nghehna a hring a, nghehna chuan beiseina a hring tih kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu beiseina chuan min tibeidawng lo va. Thlarau Thianghlim min pêk hmangin kan thinlungah hian Pathian chuan a hmangaihna chu a rawn leih ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng mah ti thei lo kan nih lai khân a hun takah Krista chu mi sualte tân a lo thi ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi fel tâna thih chu tu tân pawh a har hle ang, mi ṭha tân erawh chuan thih ngam an awm mial mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Pathianin min hmangaihzia a lanna chu - mi sual kan nih reng laiin Krista kan tân zu thi a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thisen avâng chuan Pathianin thiam min rawn chantîr ta a; thinurna lak ata chu ama zârah min va chhan chhuak dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmêlma kan nih lai maha a Fapa thihna azâra Pathian nên kan inrem tawh si chuan, Pathian nêna inrema kan awm hnu phei chuan, Krista nunna avângin chhandam kan va ni dâwn tehlul êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chauh chu a ni lo, tûna inremna min petu kan Lalpa Isua Krista zârah chuan Pathianah kan lâwm bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian mi pakhat avângin sual a lo lût a, sual avâng chuan thihna a lo awm ta a. Tichuan, khawvêl mihring zawng zawng hi thihna chuan a fan chhuak ta a ni, mi zawng zawngin thil sual an tih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dân a awm hma pawhin khawvêlah sual a awm tawh; mahse, Dân a awm loh avângin sual chu suala ngaih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Adama hun aṭanga Mosia hun thlengin, mi zawng zawng chungah Adaman Pathian thupêk awih lova thil sual a tih tâk anga sual ti ve lote chungah pawh thihna chuan thu a nei a. Adama chu lo kal tûra nên tehkhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian thilthlâwnpêk chu Adama sual nên chuan inang lo tak a ni - kha mi pakhat sual avâng khân mi tam tak an thi a: Pathian khawngaihna leh mi pakhat, Isua Krista avânga a thilthlâwnpêk chu tam takin an dawng thung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian thilpêk leh mi pakhat sual chu inang lo tak a ni sual pakhat avângin thiam loh channa a lo awm a; amaherawhchu, sual tam tak avângin khawngaiha thiam channa a lo awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi pakhat, mi mal sualna avânga khawvêlah hian thihnain ro a rêl ta a nih si chuan, mi pakhat bawk, Isua Krista avângin, Pathian khawngaihna nasa tak leh a thilthlâwnpêk thiam channa dawngtute chuan, nun changin ropui takin ro an rêl ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, mi pakhat sual avângin mi zawng zawng thiam loh chantîr an ni a, chutiang bawkin mi pakhat dik avângin mi zawng zawng thiam changin an nung thei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi pakhat thu awih lohna avâng khân mi tam tak mi sual an ni ta a, chutiang bawkin mi pakhat thuawihna avângin mi tam tak mi dik an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sual a lan chian lehzual theih nân Dân a lo awm a; nimahsela, sual a nasat poh leh khawngaihna a nasa lehzual ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, sual chuan thihnain ro a rêl a; kan Lalpa Isua Krista zâra chatuan nun kan neih theih nân Pathian khawngaihna chuan thiam chantîrnain ro a rêl ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eng nge kan sawi tâk ang le? Khawngaihna chu a pun nasat theih nân kan sual lui zêl dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dâwn suh e, keini sual thihsan tawhte chu sualah engtin nge kan la chên reng theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Krista Isuaa baptisma chang apiangte chu a thihnaah baptis-in kan awm zêl tih in hre lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baptisma kan chanin a hnênah phûmin kan awm ve a, a thihna chu kan ṭâwmpui a ni; chutiang bawkin, Pain mitthi zîng ata ropui taka Krista chu a kaihthawh ang khân, keini pawh nun tharin kan lêng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keini pawh amah nên inzawma, a thih anga kan thih ve chuan, amah a tho leh ang bawkin amah nêna inzawmin keini pawh kaihthawhin kan awm ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sual bawiha kan awm tawh loh nân sual pu taksa hi tihlum tûrin, kan mihring hlui chu a hnênah khenbehin a awm tawh tih kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thi tawh chu sual lakah a fihlîm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Krista hnêna kan thih ve tawh chuan, a hnênah kan nung ve bawk ang tih kan ring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Krista chu mitthi zîng ata kaihthawhin a awm a, a thi leh dâwn tawh lo tih kan hria, thihna chuan a chungah thu a nei tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thihna chu sual lama thih hlen vang vangna a ni a, a nunna chu Pathian hnêna nun hlenna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni pawh sual lama thi tawhah inngai ula, Krista Isuaah Pathian lama nungah inngai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, in tisa châkna zawmtîr tûr che uin in taksa thi theiah chuan sual hi lal suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In taksa pêng a enga mah thil ṭha lo tih nân sual hmantîr tawh suh u; mitthi zîng ata nung leh angin Pathian hnênah inhlân ula, in taksa pêngte pawh chu ama hnênah felna hriamhrei atân pe zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sual chuan in chungah thu a nei dâwn tawh si lo; Dân thuhnuaia awm lova, khawngaihna thuhnuaia in awm tawh zâwk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engtin nge ni ta ang le? Dân thuhnuaia awm lova, khawngaihna thuhnuaia kan awm tâk zâwk avângin kan sual zêl dâwn em ni? Sual zêl lul lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu hnênah pawh a thu awih tûra in intukluh tawh chuan, a thu in awiha bawih chu in ni - sual bawihah a nih chuan thihna, thuawihna bawihah a nih chuan thiam channa a ni ang tih in hre lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sual bawih in ni tawh a; mahse, an hlan chhâwn che u Chanchin Ṭha zirtîrna thu in dawn chu thinlung takzeta in zawm avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />sual bawih ata chu tihchhuah in ni a, dikna bawih in lo ni ta. Chuvângin, Pathian hnênah lâwmthu awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In taksa chak lohzia hriain, mihring takin thu ka sawi a ni - in taksa pêngte chu tûn hmaa bawlhhlawh leh bawhchhiatna bawihah, bawhchhe tûrin in pe ṭhîn ang khân, tûnah zawng dikna bawihah thianghlima nung tûrin pe thung tawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sual bawih in nih lai khân dikna lakah in fihlîm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûna in zahpui tâk, thil in lo tih ṭhinte kha, in hlâwkpui em? Chûng chuan a tâwpah thihna a thlen si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah zawng sual lakah tihfihlîm in ni a. Pathian bawihah in luh tâk avângin chatuan nun chang tûra tihthianghlim in ni ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sual man chu thihna a ni si a; Pathian thilthlâwnpêk erawh chu kan Lalpa Krista Isuaah chuan chatuan nunna a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, Dân in hre hlawm bawk a, ka sawi hi in hai lo vang chu, Dân chuan mi an dam chhûng chauh an chungah thu a nei a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nupui chu a pasal dam chhûng zawng a pasalah Dân chuan a phuar bet a; mahse, a pasal a thih chuan a pasal lama Dânin a phuarna chu phelhin a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pasal dam laiin mi dang a neih chuan a uire a ni a; a pasal thih hnuah erawh chuan Dân phuarna lak ata chu a fihlîm a, mi dang nei mah se uire a ni tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutiang bawk chu a ni, ka unaute u: Krista taksa pêngte in nih tâk avângin Dân chu in thihsan tawh a. Pathian tân rah kan chhuah theihna tûrin tûnah zawng mi dang ta, mitthi zîng ata kaihthawha ta chu kan ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan mihring hlui nuna kan khawsak lai kha chuan kan châkna sual, Dânin a chawh thawh khân, kan taksaah a thawk a, thihna a thlen ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûnah zawng, min phuar ṭhîntu kha kan thihsan tawh a, Dân lakah kan fihlîm tawh: Dân thu ziak hlui ang mai ni lovin, Thlarau dân tharin rawng kan bâwl zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eng nge kan sawi tâk ang le? Dân chu sual em ni? Ni suh e. Amaherawhchu, Dânin mi hriattîr lo se sual hi ka hre lo vang. Dân chuan “Awt suh,” ti lo se, awh hi ka hre lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />He thupêk hi remchânga hmangin sual chuan keimahah hian awhna chi tinrêng a chawk tho va. Dân awm lo sela chu sual hi thil thi mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmânah chuan Dân tel lovin ka nung ṭhîn a; mahse, thupêk chu a lo awm a, sual chu a lo harh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kei chu ka thi ta a. Nunna tûra thupêk chu ka tân thihna a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sual chuan thupêk chu remchânga hmangin mi bum a, mi tihlum ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dân zawng a thianghlim a ni, thupêk pawh a thianghlim a, a dik a, a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nih loh leh, thil ṭha chuan kan tân thihna a rawn thlen a ni maw? Thlen suh e. Sual zâwk hian a ni; sual a nihzia tilang tûrin thil ṭha hmangin ka tân thihna a rawn thlen a, thupêk avângin sual râpthlâkzia chu a lo lang fiah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dân chu thlarau lam thil a ni tih kan hria; kei erawh chu mihring mai, sual bawiha hralh tawh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka chêt dân hi ka hrethiam lo ve; tih ka duh chu ti lovin, ka huatzâwng chu ka ti zâwk tlat ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tih duh loh zâwng ka tih hian Dân chu a ṭha ka tihpui ve tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, keimah hi zawng a titu tak ka ni lo, keimaha sual chêng hi a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keimah mihringah hi zawng thil ṭha eng mah a awm lo tih ka hria, thil ṭha tih duhna nei ṭhîn mah ila ka ti thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tih duh thil ṭha chu ti lovin, ka duh loh thil sual chu ka ti zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka tih duh loh zâwng chu ka tih ṭhin si chuan, a titu chu keimah tak hi ka ni tawh lo tihna a ni a, keimaha sual awm hi a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hetiang hi thil awm dân a ni tih ka hre chhuak ta; Thil ṭha tih ka duh na a, thil sual ka ti leh mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka mihring chhûngril chuan Pathian Dân chu a lâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nimahsela, ka taksaah hian thawktu, dân danglam tak a awm tih ka hria; chu chuan ka chhûngril ṭha tihzâwng dân chu a do va, sual dân ka taksaa thawk ṭhîn bawihah mi siam ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi khawngaihthlâk ka va han ni tak êm! He thihna taksa lak ata hi tuin nge mi chhan chhuak ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathianin le! Kan Lalpa Isua Krista zârah ani chu fakin awm rawh se. Tichuan, ka thinlung chhûngril tak chuan Pathian Dân a zâwm a, ka taksa hi chuan sual dân a zâwm thung a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, tûnah zawng Krista Isuaa awmte tân chuan, thiam loh chantîrna rêng a awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Krista Isuaa nunna Thlarau dân chuan sual leh thihna dân ata chu min tichhuak tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tisa a chak loh avânga Dânin a tih theih hauh loh chu Pathianin a rawn ti ta; mihring tisa sual ang puin, a Fapa ngei chu sual thawi nân Pathianin a rawn tîr a, tisaa sual awm chu thiam loh a chantîr ta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tisa dâna awm tawh lo, thlarau dâna awm tawh keimahniah hian Dânin a phût chu hlena a awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tisa dâna awmte chuan tisa lam thilte an duh a, thlarau dâna awmte erawh chuan Thlarau lam thilte an duh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tisa lam thil duh chu thihna a ni si a, Thlarau lam thil duh erawh chu nunna leh thlamuanna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tisa duhzâwng chuan Pathian a do va, Pathian Dân a zâwm si lo va, zawm pawh a zâwm thei hek lo:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />chuvângin, tisa duhzâwng anga awmte chuan Pathian an tilâwm thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian Thlarau chu in hnêna a chên chuan tisa mi in ni tawh lo va, Thlarau mi in ni tawh zâwk a ni. Tu pawh Krista Thlarau nei lo chu ama mi an ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Krista chu nangmahnia a awm chuan in taksa chu sual vânga thi ni mah se, thiam chantîr in nih tawh avângin in thlarau erawh chu a nung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mitthi zîng ata Isua kaithotu Thlarau chu nangmahnia a awm chuan, mitthi zîng ata Krista kaithotu chuan nangmahniah a thlarau chêntîrin, in taksa thi thei chu a tinung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, unaute u, bat kan nei, tisa dâna tisa taka nung tûr chuan a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tisa dâna in awm chuan in thi ngei ang: amaherawhchu, in taksa châk zâwng thil sual tihte Thlarauva in tihhlum chuan in nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian Thlarau hruaia awm apiangte chu Pathian fate an ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In Thlarau dawn chu bawih anga hlauva awmtîr leh tûr che u ni lovin, fa-a siam tûr che u Thlarau a ni zâwk e; chuvâng chuan, “Abba, Ka Pa” tiin kan au chhuak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu Thlarau ngei chuan keimahni thlarau nên inkawpin, Pathian fate kan nih min hriattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian fate kan nih chuan a roluahtute kan ni, Krista tuarna kan ṭâwmpui si chuan a ropuina pawh kan ṭâwmpui ngei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûna tuarnate hi nakîna kan tân ropuina tihlan tûr nên chuan tehkhin thamah ka ruat si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thil siam zawng zawngte chuan Pathianin a fate a tihlan hun an nghâkhlel êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil siamte chu anmahni duh vâng ni lovin, a siamtu thu avângin chhiatna tâwk tûra tih an ni; amaherawhchu, beisei tûr a la awm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />thil siamte chuan chhiatna bawih ata tihchhuaha awmin Pathian fate zalênna ropui chu an ṭâwm ve dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thil siam zawng zawng chu tûn thlengin nau vei rûm angin an rûm tih kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu chang a ni lo, keini Thlarau rah hmasa dawngtute ngei pawh hi, a fa-a min siam hun, kan taksa tlanna tûr chu, nghâkhlelin kan rûm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chu beiseina avâng chuan chhandam kan ni si a; amaherawhchu, hmuh tawh reng beiseina chu beiseina a ni lo ve. A hmuh tawh reng chu tu nge la beisei fo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kan hmuh loh chu kan beisei erawh chuan kan nghâk fan fan ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, Thlarau pawh chuan kan chak lohnaah min pui ṭhîn. Engtia ṭawngṭai tûr nge tih pawh kan hre si lo va. Thlarau chuan rûm sawi hleih theih lohvin min ṭawngṭaisak ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi thinlung enfiahtu Pathian chuan, Thlarau sawi tum chu eng nge ni tih a hria; Thlarau chuan Pathian duhzâwng ang zêlin min ṭawngṭaisak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian hmangaihtu, ama ruat anga a kohte tân chuan, an ṭhatna tûrin engkimin a thawhsak ṭhîn tih kan hria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />a hriat lâwkate chu ama Fapa ang taka awm tûrin a ruat lâwk si a; tichuan, Fapa chu unau tam tak zînga fa u ber a lo ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a ruat lâwkate chu a ko va, a kohvate chu thiam a chantîr a, thiam a chantîrte chu a ropuina a chantîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chûng thu-ah chuan eng nge kan sawi tâk ang? Pathian kan lama a ṭan chuan tuin nge min do thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama Fapa ngei pawh zuah lova, kan zaa tâna petu chuan engkim a thlâwnin min pe tel lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian mi thlante chu tu nge hêk ngam ang? Pathian chu thiam chantîrtu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tu-in nge thiam loh chantîr ang? Krista Isuan maw? Ani chu kan tân a thi chauh pawh ni lovin, a tholeh a, Pa Pathian ding lama awmin min sawisaktu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Krista hmangaihna ata chu engin nge min ṭhen thei ang? Hrehawmnain emaw, mangannain emaw, tihduhdahnain emaw, ṭâmin emaw, saruaknain emaw, khandaihin emaw min ṭhen thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Nangmah avângin nilêngin thah mai hmabâkin kan awm a, berâm talh tûr anga dah kan ni,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thei suh e! Chûng zawng zawngah chuan min hmangaihtu avângin ropui taka ngamtu kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Eng mahin - thihna te, nunna te, vântirhkoh te, lalna te, thil awm sa te, thil lo la awm tûr te, thiltihtheihna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />sânna te, thûkna te, thil siam dang rêng rêng te pawhin, kan Lalpa Krista Isuaa awm Pathian hmangaihna ata chu min ṭhen thei lo vang tih ka hre chiang a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kristaah chuan thu dik tak ka sawi a ni; ka daw lo ve: Thlarau Thianghlim zârah ka chhia leh ṭha hriatna pawhin a hre chiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka rilru nasa takin a hrehawm a, ka lungngaihna pawh a reh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka unaute, tisa lama ka chipuite aiah hian ânchhia dawngin Krista hnên ata tihhran ni ila ka ti hial ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mi an ni a, fa nihna te, ropuina te, thuthlung te, Dân te, rawngbâwl hna te, Pathian thutiam te an chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlahtute chu an pute an ni a, tisa lam chhui chuan Krista ngei pawh chu an chipui a ni; engkim chunga awm Pathian chu chatuana fakin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian thu chu a thlâwn ta tihna zawng a ni hauh lo; Israela thlah zawng zawng Israel mi an ni vek lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrahama thlah zawng zawng pawh a fate an ni vek hek lo. “Isaka-ah hian i thlahte chhui an ni ang,” Pathianin a tih zâwk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, tisa lama a fate chu Pathian fate an ni chuang kher lo, Pathian thutiam avânga a fate erawh chu Abrahama thlah dik taka ngaih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tûn ang hunah hian ka lo kal ang a, Sari chuan fapa a nei ang,” ti-a tiam a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu chang chu a ni hlei nêm: mi pakhat, min thlahtu Isaka lakah Rebeki chuan phîr a pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />naute pian hma, a chhia emaw, a ṭha emaw an tih theih hma khân Pathianin a duhzâwng angin pakhat zâwk a thlang a ni tih a lang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />thiltih avâng ni lovin, a kotu duhzâwng avâng zâwkin Rebeki hnênah, “A upa zâwkin a naupang zâwk rawng a bâwl ang,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Jakoba ka hmangaih a, Esauva erawh chu ka hua,” tih ziak a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuti a nih si chuan eng nge kan sawi tâk ang? Pathianah dik lohna a awm em ni? Awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka khawngaih apiang chu ka khawngaih ang a, zah ka ngaihna chung apiangah zah ka ngai ang,” tia Mosia hnêna a sawi kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, mihring duh thu emaw, thiltih emaw ni lovin, Pathian khawngaihnaah a innghat zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in Farawa hnênah, “He mi avâng ngawt hian ka tungding che a ni, nangmaha ka thiltihtheihna ka entîr theihna tûr leh, khawvêl zawng zawnga ka hming a than theih nân,” a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian chuan a duh apiang a khawngaih ṭhîn a, a duh apiang pawh a tiluhlul ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Chuti chu Pathianin engati nge mi a la dem cheu vang? A duhzâwng chu tu nge dodâl thei awm?” in ti a ni thei e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw mihring, Pathian hnial veitu chu tu nge maw i nih le? Thilsiam chuan a siamtu hnênah, “Engati nge hetianga mi siam?” a ti ang em ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bellei tlang khat aṭangin bêl hlu deuh te, hlu lo deuh te siam tûrin bêlvawtu chuan bellei chungah thu a nei lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Pathianin a ti ṭhîn; a thinur leh a thiltihtheihna chu lantîr duh mah se, a thinurna dawngtu bêl, tihboral mai tûrte chu a dawh hrâm hrâm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tin, a khawngaihna bêl, a ropuina chang tûra a buatsaih keiniho hnênah hian ropuina nasa tak a rawn tilang thung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda-te zîng ata chauh ni lovin, Jentail-te zîng ata a koh chhuahte hi chutiang bêlte chu kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hosea lehkhabuah hetianga a sawi kha: “Ka mi ni ngai lote chu ‘Ka mite,’ ka ti ang a, Hmangaihngailohvi chu ‘Hmangaihi,’ ka ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Ka mite in ni lo ve,’ an tihna hmunah ngei chuan Pathian nung fate vuah in ni ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isaia pawh khân Israel mite thu aupuiin, “Israel mite chu tuifinriat ṭiau zâtin tam mah sela, a bâng tlêm tê chauh chhandam an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa chuan lei chunga a rorêlna tûr chu a hlen thuai dawn si,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isaia vêkin, “Engkim Lalpa chuan a chi thlah min lo zuahsak suh sela chuan, Sodom khua ang kan ni tawh ang a, Gomora khua ang mai kan ni tawh ang,” tia a lo sawi lâwk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eng nge kan sawi tâk ang le? Jentail thiam chan tum lêm lote chu thiam chantîr an lo ni ta, rinna avânga thiam chantîrna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Dân zâwma thiam chan tum Israel-te zâwk chuan Dân ang chuan thiam an chang zo ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Eng vâng nge ni? Rinna lova thiltiha hmuh an tum vâng a ni a, Tlûkna lungah chuan an tlu ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Ngai teh, Zion-ah chuan inchhuiha tlûkna lung, Insuta tlûkna lungpui ka dah a, Tu pawh amah ring apiang chu An mualpho lo vang,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, ka chipuite chu chhandam ni se tih hi ka duhthusâm leh Pathian hnêna ka dîl ber ṭhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian tân ṭhahnem an ngaih nasatzia ka hria, hre chiang lovin ṭhahnem an ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathianin mi thiam a chantîr dân chu an hrethiam lo va, anmahni kawng an zawh tlat a, Pathianin thiam a chantîr dân hnuaiah an intulût duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ring apiangte thiam chantîra an awm theihna tûrin, Krista chu Dân tibângtu a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosia chuan Dân zawm avânga thiam chan chungchâng thu heti hian a ziak: “Dân zâwmtu chu a nung ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rinna avânga thiam chan chungchâng thu erawh chu, “ ‘Tu nge vânah lâwn ang?’ (Chu chu chung lam ata tu nge Krista hruai chhuk ang, tihna a ni) emaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Tu nge leilâwtah chhuk ang?’ (chu chu, mitthi khua ata tu nge Krista hruai chhuak ang, tihna a ni) emaw, in rilruin ti suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Thu chuan a hnaih a che, i kâah leh i thinlungah a awm,” a ti zâwk a ni. ‘Thu’ tih chu rinna thu kan hril hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I kâin Isua chu Lalpa a ni tih i ṭana, mitthi zîng ata Pathianin a kaitho tih i thinlunga i rin chuan, chhandam i ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thinlunga ring chu thiam chantîr an ni a, kâa ṭan chu chhandam an ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in, “A ring chu tu mah an mualpho lo vang,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda nih emaw, Grik nih emaw danglamna a awm chuang lo; Lalpa pakhat chu an zaa Lalpa a ni a; amah lamtu apiangte tân chuan engkim a ngah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tu pawh Lalpa hming lam apiang chhandam an ni ang,” tih a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An rin lohva chu engtin nge an lam theih ang? An hriat lohva chu engtin nge an rin theih ang? Hrilhtu an awm si loh chuan engtin nge an hriat ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tirh an nih si loh chuan tu nge hril ang? “Thil ṭha chanchin rawn hriltute ke chu a va mawi êm!” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Chanchin Ṭha chu an za-in an awih vek lo. Isaia ngei pawhin, “Lalpa, kan thu sawi tuin nge ring?” a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, rinna chu thu hril an hriat avângin a lo awm a, thu hril chu Isua Krista thu hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nih leh, an bengin an hre ngai lo vem ni? Hria e a! “An thâwm chu ram tinah a thang a, an thu chu kâwlkil thlengin a thang chhuak ta,” tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nih leh Israel miten an hre ve lo vem ni? “Chi-a sawi tham lohte chu ka thîktîr ang che u a, Chi fing lote avângin ka tithinur dâwn che u a ni,” tiin Mosia chuan a sawi hmasa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaia chuan a sawi huai lehzual a: “Mi zawng lote chuan mi hmu a, Mi lam lote hnênah ka inhriattîr a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-ho chungchâng thu-ah erawh chuan, “Mi tihmawh leh hel hmangho tân Nilêngin ka bân ka phar ṭhîn,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A nih leh, Pathian chuan a mite chu a paih thla kan ti dâwn em ni? Paih thla suh e. Kei ngei pawh Israel mi, Abrahama thlah, Benjamin hnam ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathianin a mi hriat lâwkate chu a paih thla lo ve. Elija chanchin Lehkha Thua chuang kha in hre lo vem ni? Ani chuan Israel mite chungthu Pathian hnênah a thlen a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lalpa, i zâwlneite an tihlum a, I maichâmte an tichim a, Keimah chauh hi ka la awm a, Kei pawh mi tihhlum an tum a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathianin engtin nge a chhân kha? “Baala hmaa ṭhingṭhi ngai lo mi sângsarih keima tân ka la zuah reng a ni,” tiin a chhâng a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah pawh chutiang bawk chuan Pathianin a khawngaihna avânga a thlan chhuahte chu tlêm tê chauh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khawngaihna avânga thlan chhuah an nih chuan, an thiltih vâng a ni thei lo; chuti ni se khawngaihna chu khawngaihna a ni thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engtin nge ni ta ang le? Israel-te chuan an zawn chu an hmu lo va, Pathian thlan tlêm tê chauhvin an hmu, mi dang zawng zawng chu an chawlawl zo vek ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Pathianin vawiin thlengin rilru muthlu a pe a, hmu thei lo mit leh hre thei lo beng nên,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Davida chuan, “An ruai siam chu an tân thang leh fal ni sela, Tlûkna leh thungrulhna ni rawh se!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hmuh theih loh nân an mit chu thim sela, Rit phurin kûl reng rawh se,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nih leh an tlûk avângin an chhe hlen dâwn em ni? Chhe hlen suh e, an tlûk avângin Jentail-te hnênah chhandamna a lo thleng a, Israel-te awh tûra lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, an tlûkna mah khawvêl tihhausakna a niha, an tlâkhniamna mah Jentail-te hausakna a nih bawk si chuan, an lo tel kim hun chuan eng ang tak ni ang maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangni Jentail-te hnênah thu ka sawi a nih hi. Kei hi Jentail tâna tirhkoh ka nih avângin ka rawngbâwl hna hi ka ngai ropui a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka chipuite ka thîktîr che u a, a ṭhen tal ka chhandam theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anmahni paihthlâkna mah khawvêl hi Pathian ṭhiana siam lehna a nih si chuan, anmahni lawm luh lehna chu thihna ata nun lehna a ni dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhang hmeh lai hlâwm ata sawh thlâk hmasak ber chu serh thianghlim a nih chuan, a hlâwm pum pawh serh thianghlim a ni; tin, thing pawh a zung a thianghlim chuan a zârte pawh a thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Oliv thingzâr ṭhenkhat chu sât thlain, nangni oliv suakte chu oliv kûngah chuan zawm in ni a; zung ṭha chu in ṭâwm ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zâr dangte lakah chuan inchhuang mah ula, a zung châwmtu in ni lo, a zungin a châwm zâwk che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, nangin, “Zawma ka awmna tûr zârte chu sah thlâk a ni alâwm,” i ti ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I ti dik e; an rin loh avângin sah thlâk an ni a, nang chu i rin avângin zawm i ni. Chapo mai teh suh, hlau zâwk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathianin zâr takte chu a zuah si loh chuan nang pawh a zuah bîk lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian ṭhatzia leh a ṭihbaiawmzia hi ngaihtuah teh; tlute tân a ṭihbaiawm a, a ṭhatnaa i awm reng chuan, nanga tân zawng a ṭha a ni; i awm reng loh chuan nang pawh sah thlâk i ni ve mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, anni pawh ring lova an awm reng loh chuan zawmin an awm leh ang, Pathianin anni chu a zawm leh thei si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang oliv suak ata sah chhûm mah, pianphung pângngai ang lova oliv thing ṭhaa zawm i nih si chuan, oliv zâr dik tak chu oliv thing dikah chuan zawm a va awlsam zâwk dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Unaute u, he thurûk hi in hriat loh ka duh si lo; chutilo chu, fing tâwk in lo inti dah ang e; Jentail-te an tel kim hma chu Israel mi ṭhenkhatte chungah chawlawlna a lo thleng rih a ni, tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan a ni, Israel mi zawng zawng chhandam an nih dâwn ni. “Zion aṭangin Chhandamtu chu a lo chhuak ang a, Jakoba hnên ata suahsualna a ti bo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Chu chu an hnêna ka thuthlun tûr chu a ni, An sualte ka lâk bo hunah chuan,’ tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha an hnâwl avângin Juda-te chu Pathian hmêlma an ni a; nangni chan a ṭhat phah a; mahse, Pathianin a thlan avângin thlahtute azârah a ṭhian duh takte an ni tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathianin mal a sâwm tawh leh a thlan tawh chu sût leh theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmânah chuan Pathian thu in awih lo va, tûnah zawng annin an awih loh avângin a khawngaihna in dawng ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />chutiang bawkin, tûnah nangnin khawngaihna in dawn avângin, anni pawhin khawngaihna an dawn ve theih nân tûnah hian an awih rih lo a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An zavaia chungah a khawngaihna a lantîr duh avângin Pathian chuan mi zawng zawng awih lohnaah a khung khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian hausakzia, a finna leh a hriatna chu a va thûk êm! A rorêl dân chu hriat phâk rual loh, a kawngte chu chhui theih rual loh a ni!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Lalpa rilru chu tu nge hriaa, tu nge a remruatsaktuah ṭang tawh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A rulh leh tûra a hnêna thil pe tu nge awm ngai le?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thil zawng zawng hi amah aṭanga lo awm, amah avâng leh ama tâna awm a ni. A hnênah chatuanin ropuina chu awm rawh se; Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuvângin, unaute u, Pathian khawngaihna avâng hian, inthawina nung leh thianghlim, Pathian lawm tlâk ni tûrin, in taksa chu a hnêna hlân tûrin ka ngên a che u, chutiang chu in rawngbâwl dân tûr tak a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûnlai khawvêl awm dân ang hi ṭâwm suh u; in nun phung chu, in rilru tihthara awmin, tihdanglam ni vek rawh se; tichuan, Pathian duhzâwng, ṭha leh lawm tlâk leh ṭhat famkim chu in hrethiam thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian mi pêk khawngaihna avâng hian in zînga tu mah inngaihlu lutuk lo tûrin ka ngên a che u. Pathianin mi tin hnêna rinna a pêk ang zêlin mahni phu tâwk rilru pu rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Taksa pum khatah pêng hrang tam tak kan nei a, pêng zawng zawngin thawh hrang an nei ṭheuh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chutiang bawkin keini pawh tam tak ni mah ila, Kristaah chuan taksa pumkhat kan ni a, kan za hian taksa pêng anga inzawm tawn ṭheuh kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawngaihna min pêk ang zêlin thilthlâwnpêk hrang hrang kan dawng ṭheuh a ni; thu hril lam a nih chuan, kan rinna ang zêlin hril ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />rawngbâwl lam a nih chuan, ṭhahnemngai takin bâwl ila, zirtîr lam a nih chuan zirtîr ila;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mi thlamuan tûr a nih chuan theihtâwp chhuah ila; petu chuan phal takin pe sela, rorêltu chuan taima takin rêl sela, puih ngai puitu chuan hlim takin pui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmangaihna chu vervêkna tel lovin ni rawh se. Sual chu hua ula, a ṭha chu pawm tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unau inlainat angin inlainat tawn ula, inchawimawi tawn uar rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inthlahdul hauh lovin rilru phûr takin Lalpa rawng chu bâwl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Beiseina chuan tilâwm che u sela, tihduhdah in tuar pawhin chhel takin tuar ula, eng lai pawhin ṭawngṭai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unau tlachhamte chu chhawmdâwl ula, mikhual lawm chîng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tiduhdahtu che u chu malsâwm ula, ânchhia lawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lâwmte chu lâwmpui ula, ṭapte chu ṭahpui rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Angkhat vekin inen ula, intivei suh u, mi tête pâwl zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sual chu sual vêkin thungrûl lo ula, mi zawng zawng ngaiha mawi ngaihtuah zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangni chuan in theihtâwpin mi zawng zawng nên inrem tum rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Duh takte u, phuba la suh ula, Pathian thinurna kian zâwk rawh u. “ ‘Phuba rêng rêng keima lâk tûr a ni, keiman ka thungrûl ang,’ Lalpan a ti,” tih ziak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, i hmêlma a rilṭâm chuan ei tûr pe rawh, a tuihâl chuan in tûr pe rawh; chutianga i tih chuan a zak êm êm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sual ngam chein awm suh la, ṭhatnain sual chu ngam zâwk rawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi tinin an chunga rorêltute thu an awih tûr a ni. Pathian ruat lohvin rorêltu an awm thei lo; tûna rorêltute pawh hi Pathian ruat an ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, rorêltu dodâl chuan Pathian ruat a dodâl a ni; dodâltu chuan ama chungah hremna a thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rorêltu chu thil ṭha titu tân a hlauhawm lo, thil sual titu tân erawh chuan a hlauhawm a ni. Rorêltu hlau lova awm i duh em? Thil ṭha ti la, a fak i hlawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I ṭhatna tûra Pathian rawngbâwltu a ni si a. Thil sual i tih erawh chuan hlau rawh, khandaih chu a keng mai mai lo a nia. Pathian rawngbâwltu a ni a, thil sual titute chunga Pathian hremna kengkawhtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, hrem hlauh vâng mai ni lovin, i chhia leh ṭha hriatna avâng pawhin a thu i zâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutiang a nih avâng chuan chhiah pawh in chawi ṭhîn; thuneitute chuan an hna ṭha taka an thawh chuan Pathian rawng an bâwl a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pêk tûra ruat apiangte hnênah pe ula, lei man pêk tûr a nih leh pe ula, chhiah chawi tûr a nih leh chawi ula, ṭih tûr chu ṭih ula, pawisak tûr chu pawisa rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inhmangaih tawnna ngawt lo chu tu ma eng mah ba suh u; mahni mihringpui hmangaihtu chuan Dân a zawh famkim tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng, “Uire suh, tual that suh, ru suh; awt suh” tih leh thupêk dang rêng rêngte hi, “Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte i hmangaih tûr a ni,” tih hian a khai khâwm vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmangaihnain vêngte a tikhawlo ngai lo va; chuvângin, hmangaihna hi Dân zawh famkimna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnlai thil awmzia hi in hria e; muhîl thawhharh a hun takzet tawh a, tûnah chuan kan rin tirh lai ai khân chhandam kan nihna tûr ni chu a hnai zâwk tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zân hi a ral lek lek tawh a, khua a vâr dâwn ta; chhûn ênga awmte angin mawi takin khawsa ila, thim thiltih chu paihin, êng thuamin i inthuam ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zu in buai leh ruia awm lovin, hur leh inngaih hmanga awm lovin, insual leh inîtsîka awm hek lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Isua Krista chuan inthuam zâwk ula, in tisa châkna puitlin tum rêng rêng suh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rinnaa mi chak lo chu, a ngaih dân hnial tum kher lovin lâwm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi pakhatin engkim ei hi thiangin a ring a, mi chak lo erawh chuan thlai chauh a ei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engkim ei mi chuan a ei lo chu hmusit suh se; a ei lo pawhin a ei mi chu sawisêl suh se, Pathianin ani chu a lâwm tho a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi dang chhiahhlawh lo sawisêltu chu tu nge maw i nih le? A din ngheh emaw, a tlûk emaw chu ama pu thu thu a ni. A ding nghet ngei ang; Lalpa chuan a din chhuahtîr thei si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mi dangin ni khat hi ni dang aiin a ngaihlu bîk a, mi dangin ni zawng zawng hi inang ṭheuhvin a ngai thung a. Mi tinin mahni ngaih dân bulfûk mumal neih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni pakhat serh bîktu chuan Lalpa chawimawi nân a serh a ni; engkim eitu chuan, Pathian hnêna lâwmthu sawi zeta ei a nih avângin Lalpa chu a chawimawi a ni. Ei lama insûm mi pawh chuan Pathian hnêna lâwmthu a sawi tho avângin Lalpa chawimawi nân a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu mah mahni tâna nung kan ni lo va, tu mah mahni tâna thi kan ni hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kan nun chuan Lalpa tân kan nung a ni a, kan thih pawhin Lalpa tân kan thi a ni; chuvângin, kan nun pawhin, kan thih pawhin Lalpa ta kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, mi nung leh mitthi Lal a nih theih nân Krista chu a thi a, a nung leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engtizia nge nangin i unaupa i sawisêl mai? Engati nge nang pawh i unaupa chu i hmuhsit mai? Pathian rorêlna ṭhutthlêng hmaah chuan kan la ding ṭheuh dâwn asin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Minunga chu ka ni, Mi tinrêng ka hmaah an ṭhingṭhi ang a. Lei tinrêngin Pathian ka nih an puang ang,’ Lalpan a ti,” tih ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, kan za-in Pathian hmaah mahni chanchin kan sawi ṭheuh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, insawisêl chîng tawh suh u, tu pawhin mahni unau tlûkna tûr emaw, lungnihlohna tûr emaw siam loh tum zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Isuaah chuan thil rêng rêng amah ngawtah chuan thiang lo eng mah a awm lo tih ka hre chiang a ni; amaherawhchu, thil ṭhenkhat chu, thiang lova ngaitu tân chuan a thiang lo a ni mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I englo ei avânga i unau rilru a nat chuan, hmangaihna kawng i zawh tawh lo va ni. A thih ai Kristan a thihsaka chhiatna chu i thil eiin thlen suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭha in tih zâwng chu mi sawichhiat lam chi ni suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian ram chu ei leh in lam thu a ni si lo va, Thlarau Thianghlim zâra thiam channa te, remna te, lâwmna te a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutianga Krista rawngbâwltu tawh phawt chu Pathian lâwmzâwng mi a ni a, mihring fak pawh a hlawh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, inremna tûr leh intihsâwt tawnna tûr thilte chu i ûm ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I thil ei avângin Pathian hnathawh tichhe suh. Thil engkim ei hi thian zawng a thiang a ni; mahse, mi dang tlûk theihna thil ei erawh chu a ṭha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sa ei te, zu in te, unau tlûk theihna tûr thil rêng rêng tih hi chîn loh a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I rin dân chuan ring mai la, Pathian nêna in inkâr thu a ni. Mahni rin ang zâwng tia, inthiam lohna nei lo chu a nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Inthiam lo chunga ei chuan thiam loh a chang reng tawh a ni; a rin dân anga ti a nih loh avângin. Eng pawh rinna lova tih chu sual a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keini mi chak zâwkte hian mahni lâwmna zawng lovin, chak lo zâwkte chu an chak lohnaah kan ṭanpui tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Intihsâwt tawn nân mahni vêngte tilâwmin an tâna ṭha tih i tum ṭheuh vang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Krista pawhin mahni lâwmna a zawng si lo, “Nangmah chêksawlhtute chêksawlhna chu ka chungah a tla ta,” tih ziak ang khân a tuar zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lehkha Thua lo ziak tawh rêng rêng chu min zirtîr tûra ziak a ni, thu ziak aṭanga chhelna leh thlamuanna kan dawn azâra beiseina kan neih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chhelna leh thlamuanna petu Pathian chuan, Krista Isua thu angin rilru hmunkhat puttîr che u sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thinlung hmun khat pua thukhat vuain, kan Lalpa Isua Krista Pa leh Pathian chu in fak za thei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian ropuina tûrin Krista chuan a lâwm che u ang khân inlâwm tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, Pathian rinawmzia tihchian nân thlahtute hnêna a thutiam hlenin, Krista chu serh tanho rawngbâwltuah a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jentail-te pawhin a khawngaihna avânga Pathian an chawimawi theihna tûrin: “Tichuan, Jentail-te zîngah ka fak ang chia, I hming fakin ka zai ang,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hetiang hian a ti bawk, “Jentail-te u, a mite nên lâwm rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hetiang pawh hian a ti: “Jentail zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u, Ama mite zawng zawng pawhin fak rawh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isaia pawhin heti hian a ti: “Jesaia zung zâm chu a awm ang a, Jentail-te lal tûrin a lo chhuak ang. Amahah Jentail-te chuan an beiseina an nghat ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim thiltihtheihna azârah beiseinaa in khah theihna tûrin, beiseina hnâr Pathian chuan in rin avângin lâwmna leh thlamuanna tinrêngin vûr che u rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka unaute u, nangniho hi ṭhatnaa khat, finna tinrêng ngaha, inzirtîr tawn thei tûr in nih ka ring tlat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />amaherawhchu, thil ṭhenkhat hriat nawntîr tûr che uin ka rawn ziak tho va. Jentail-te tâna thawk tûra Pathianin Krista rawngbâwl hna mi rawn hlan hi chhuangin ka ziak huai hle nghe nghe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentail-te chu Thlarau Thianghlima Pathian hnêna lawm tlâka inthawina atân hlan tûrin Chanchin Ṭha hril hi ka puithiam hna a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Krista Isuaah chuan Pathian rawng ka bâwl hi ka chhuang hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jentail-te awihtîr tûra thu leh thiltihte, chhinchhiahna leh thil mak tihtheihnate leh Thlarau Thianghlim thiltihtheihnatea Kristan keimah hmanga a thiltihte lo chu eng mah ka sawi ngam si lo. Jerusalem aṭangin Illurikon leh a chhehvêl thlengin Krista Chanchin Ṭha chu hmun tinah ka hril vek tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi dang lungphûm chunga rem chho ka nih loh nân, Krista la hriat lohna hmun apiangah Chanchin Ṭha puan hi ka duh dân a ni si a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A chanchin la hril ngai lohnaa mite chuan An hmu ang a, La hre ngai lote chuan an hria ang,” tih ziak ang khân hril ka tum zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni, in hnêna lo kal ka ṭhulh leh ṭhin ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan hêng lai ramah hian kalna tûr ka nei ta lo va; kum tam tak chhûng rawn tlawh che u ka châk tawh bawk nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Spain ram kal pahin lo kal ka inbeisei a, nangni nên inpâwl kham tê tê ila, kal ka tumna lama mi thlah ka beisei bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tûnah tak hi chuan mi thianghlimho rawngbâwl tûrin Jerusalem khuaah ka kal rih dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Makedonia leh Akaia rama mite chuan phal takin Jerusalem khuaa mi thianghlimho zînga retheite tân thawhlâwm an thawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Phal taka ti an ni; amaherawhchu, an lakah bat an nei ve rêng a ni; Jentail-ten an thlarau lam thilte an ṭâwmpui chuan, khawvêl lam thilah anmahni chhawmdâwl ve thung âwm rêng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu chu ka tiha, thawhlâwm chu an hnêna ka hlan fel hnuah, nangmahni tlawhin Spain ramah ka kal zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, in hnêna ka lo kal hun chuan Krista malsâwmna famkim nên ka lo kal ang tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Unaute u, kan Lalpa Isua Krista leh Thlarau Thianghlim zâra in hmangaihnain Pathian hnêna mi ṭawngṭaipui ngat ngat tûrin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judai rama ring lote laka ka him theih nân te, ka rawngbâwlna hi Jerusalem-a mi thianghlimte tân thil lâwmawm tak a nih theih nân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />rilru hlim taka ka lo kal theiha, Pathianin rem a tih chuan kan intihharh tawn theih nân te mi ṭawngṭaisak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Remna Pathian chu in zaa hnênah awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan farnu, Foibi, Kenkriai kohhrana rawngbâwltu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hminga mi thianghlimte tih âwm rênga lo lâwm tûr leh, puih a ngaihna apianga lo pui tûrin ka duh che u a ni. Amah pawh hi mi tam tak puitu a lo ni ṭhîn a, kei ngei pawh hi mi pui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Priski leh Akuila, Krista Isuaa ka hnathawhpuite kha, chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chuan ka nun chhanhim nân thih pawh an huam kha; kei chang ni lovin, Jentail kohhran zawng zawng pawh an chungah an lâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An ina kohhran inkhâwmho kha chibai ka bûk e. Ka duh tak Epainata, Asia rama Krista ring hmasa bera kha, chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mari, in tân rim taka thawktu kha, chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Andronika leh Junia, ka chipui leh ka tânpuite kha, chibai ka bûk e; anni chu tirhkohte zînga hmingthang tak an ni a, kei aia Krista ring hmasa an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ampliata, Lalpaa ka duh tak kha, chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kristaa ka thawhpui Urbana leh ka duh tak Stakua kha chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kristaa mi tak, Apelia kha chibai ka bûk e. Aristobula chhûngte chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka chipui Herodiana kha chibai ka bûk e. Narkisa te chhûng zînga mi Lalpaa awmte kha chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Trufaini leh Trufosi, Lalpaa thawk rim ṭhînte kha, chibai ka bûk e. Duh tak Persi, Lalpa tâna rim taka thawk ṭhîn kha, chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa hnaa mi langsâr tak Rufa leh a nu, ka nu ve bawk kha, chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asunkrita te, Flegona te, Hermea te, Patroba te, Herma te, an hnêna unau awmte nên, chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Filologoa leh Juli nên, Nirea leh a farnu nên, Olumpa nên, an hnêna mi thianghlim awm zawng zawng nên chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Fawh thianghlimin inchibai tawn ula, Krista kohhran hian chibai kan bûk bawk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Unaute u, zirtîrna thu in dawn kalh zâwnga in zînga inṭhenna leh tlûkna chawk chhuaktute lakah fîmkhur ula, anni chu hawisan tûrin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang mite chuan kan Lalpa Krista rawng an bâwl lo va, mahni pumpui rawngbâwl mai an ni. An ṭawng hmang thiam leh kam ṭhatin mi mâwlte chu an bum ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭhaa in nghehzia hi mi tin hriat a ni; chuvângin, kei pawh in chungah ka lâwm a ni. Thil ṭha lama finga, sual lama in fihlîm ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Remna Pathian chuan Setana chu in ke hnuaiah a rahbehtîr thuai dâwn che u a ni. Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka hnathawhpui Timothea leh ka chipui Lukia te, Jasona te, Sosipatera te hian chibai an bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei, Tertia, he lehkha ziaktu hian, Lalpa hmingin chibai ka bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka thlen in-pa, kohhran inkhâwm thlengtu Gaia hian, chibai a bûk a che u. Khaw sum enkawltu Erasta leh a unaupa Kuarta pawhin chibai an bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu in zaa hnênah awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian chu i chawimawi ang u; Ani chuan Isua Krista thu, Chanchin Ṭha kan hrilh leh tûn hnua thu ril inthup lo inpuang ta ang hian, in rinnaah nghet takin a dintîr thei che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tûnah zawng chu thu inthup ṭhîn chu Zâwlneite Lehkhaah a lo lang a, tu pawhin an rina an awih theihna tûrin, chatuan Pathian thupêk anga hnam tin zînga hriattîr a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian awm chhun, finga chu, Isua Krista avângin chatuanin ropui rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
